[b]v1.4.0 — Per-character table[/b]
[list]
[*]The per-character list in the Statistics tab is now a [b]real table[/b] with aligned columns: kills, KOs, stealth KOs and limbs. Click a column header to sort by it. Suggested by az455862.
[*][b]Fixed:[/b] the same character could show up twice after moving to another squad (the game gives it a new internal id). Duplicates are merged automatically, including in existing saves.
[/list]
Existing progress is kept. Requires RE_Kenshi v0.3.5+. Full changelog: [url=https://github.com/LucasSKrewer/kenshi-achievements/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md]GitHub[/url]
